{"unit_id":"tag:0D7N:title","translation":"上同调（cohomological）下降（descent）的形式性质（Formalities）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cohomological","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"Formalities","target_term":"形式性质"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cohomological","target_term":"上同调","context":"节标题中的上同调下降"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"节标题"},{"source_term":"Formalities","target_term":"形式性质","context":"节标题中的形式性质"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0D7N:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节仅讨论赋环拓扑斯态射（morphism of ringed topoi）在何种程度上确定嵌入（embedding），从下方的导出范畴（derived category）到上方的导出范畴（derived category）。下面给出一个典型结果。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"embedding","target_term":"嵌入"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯态射","context":"本节考察的态射"},{"source_term":"embedding","target_term":"嵌入","context":"两侧导出范畴之间的嵌入"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"态射两侧的导出范畴"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0D7Q:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环拓扑斯态射（morphism of ringed topoi）。考虑满子范畴（full subcategory）<MATH_0002>，由对象（objects）<MATH_0003> 组成，满足\n<MATH_0004>\n为同构（isomorphism）。则 <MATH_0005> 为饱和的（saturated）三角的（triangulated）严格（strictly）满子范畴（full subcategory），属于 <MATH_0006>，且函子（functor）<MATH_0007> 为全忠实的（fully faithful）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的"},{"source_term":"triangulated","target_term":"三角的"},{"source_term":"strictly","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯态射","context":"拉回与直像对应的态射"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴","context":"单位比较为同构的对象所成子范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"导出对象"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"单位比较映射的性质"},{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的","context":"三角子范畴的饱和性"},{"source_term":"triangulated","target_term":"三角的","context":"子范畴的三角性质"},{"source_term":"strictly","target_term":"严格","context":"严格满子范畴的限定"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"限制到子范畴的导出拉回"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的","context":"导出拉回的性质"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0D7Q:proof","translation":"关于此情形中饱和的（saturated）的定义，见《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》定义 <REF_0001>。关于三角（triangulated）子范畴（subcategories）的讨论，见《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0002>。引理中的典范映射（canonical map）是单位（unit），对应于伴随（adjoint）函子（functors）对（pair）<MATH_0001>，见引理 <REF_0003>。说明这些后，省略 <MATH_0002> 为饱和的（saturated）三角（triangulated）子范畴（subcategory）的证明；这形式地由 <MATH_0003> 和 <MATH_0004> 为正合（exact）函子（functors）这一事实得出，它们在三角范畴（triangulated categories）之间。最后一部分形式地由 <MATH_0005> 和 <MATH_0006> 互为伴随（adjoint）这一事实得出；比较《范畴（Categories）》引理 <REF_0004>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"triangulated","target_term":"三角"},{"source_term":"subcategories","target_term":"子范畴"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"unit","target_term":"单位"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"对"},{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的"},{"source_term":"triangulated","target_term":"三角"},{"source_term":"subcategory","target_term":"子范畴"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"triangulated categories","target_term":"三角范畴"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的","context":"三角子范畴的饱和性"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"triangulated","target_term":"三角","context":"子范畴的三角结构"},{"source_term":"subcategories","target_term":"子范畴","context":"三角子范畴"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"伴随单位"},{"source_term":"unit","target_term":"单位","context":"伴随函子对的单位"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随","context":"导出拉回与直像的伴随"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"导出拉回与直像"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"对","context":"伴随函子对"},{"source_term":"subcategory","target_term":"子范畴","context":"单位为同构的对象所成子范畴"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"导出函子的正合性"},{"source_term":"triangulated categories","target_term":"三角范畴","context":"导出函子两侧的范畴"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用章名"}],"notes":[]}
